## 5. REST inventory ที่ต้อง freeze ใน api-spec.md

ชื่อ path ต่อไปนี้เป็นข้อเสนอให้เข้ากับ Express app; คง Requester public route names เดิมเท่าที่ทำได้ แต่ identity ต้อง secure จริง อย่าเพิ่ม route ใหม่แล้วปล่อย route เก่า bypass ได้

| Method/path (proposed) | Request / success data | Permission / critical behavior |
|---|---|---|
| POST /api/auth/login | email,password → 200 {user,mustChangePassword} + cookie | public; 401/429; safe DTO |
| GET /api/auth/me | →200 {user:{id,name,email,role,mustChangePassword}} | valid limited/full session; 401 otherwise |
| GET /api/auth/csrf | →200 {csrfToken} | valid limited/full session; no-store; trusted-origin policy |
| POST /api/auth/logout | →204 | invalidate cookie/session, idempotent behavior documented |
| POST /api/auth/change-password | currentPassword,newPassword,confirmPassword →200 safe user | limited/full own session, CSRF, rotate/revoke |
| Existing Requester Ticket APIs | retain accepted business fields and safe response | authenticated Requester; derive owner; 404 foreign |
| Existing Requester Attachment APIs | preserve upload/list/download/soft-remove contracts | own Ticket + attachment relation + removed-state rules |
| GET /api/staff/tickets | documented query →200 paginated summary DTO | IT Staff only |
| GET /api/staff/tickets/:id | →200 permitted detail incl operational fields/version | IT Staff; 404 missing |
| GET /api/staff/ticket-owners | →200 [{id,name,role}] | Staff; active Staff/Admin only; minimal DTO |
| POST /api/staff/tickets/:id/claim | expectedVersion →200 updated detail/version | Staff; atomic unassigned claim; 409 conflict |
| PATCH /api/staff/tickets/:id/owner | ownerId,expectedVersion →200 | Staff; eligibility/active checks; 409 stale |
| PATCH /api/staff/tickets/:id/it-priority | itPriority,expectedVersion →200 | Staff; immutable requestedPriority |
| PATCH /api/staff/tickets/:id/status | status,expectedVersion →200 | Staff; matrix validation; no Actions Taken prerequisite |
| GET /api/tickets/:id/public-comments | →200 {data:[{id,body,author:{id,name},createdAt}]} | own Requester/Staff/Admin read |
| POST /api/tickets/:id/public-comments | body →201 safe entry | own Requester/Staff; server author/time |
| GET /api/tickets/:id/internal-notes | →200 note DTO | Staff/Admin; Requester 403 before lookup |
| POST /api/tickets/:id/internal-notes | body →201 safe entry | Staff only under proposed matrix |
| POST /api/tickets/:id/appears-resolved | no actor/time/status in request →200 indicator | own Requester; idempotent; formal status unchanged |
| GET /api/admin/tickets/:id | →200 read-only safe detail | Admin read grant; no operational mutations |
| GET /api/admin/users | search, optional role →200 safe users | Admin; no hashes/credentials/sessions |
| POST /api/admin/users | name,email,role,active,initialPassword →201 user | Admin; exactly 1 role; hash+force-change |
| PATCH /api/admin/users/:id | name,email,role,active →200 user | Admin; self/last-admin/owner policy transaction |
| POST /api/admin/users/:id/initial-password | initialPassword →204 | Admin; hash+mustChange+revoke sessions |

Existing Ticket read/download routes ต้องรองรับ Staff/Admin read permissions หรือเพิ่ม explicit role paths ตาม approved contract แต่ห้าม reuse requester mutation route โดยให้ข้าม ownership แบบกว้าง

API spec ต้องแสดง JSON จริงอย่างน้อยสำหรับ auth success, password-change-required, validation fields, paginated queue, ticket detail แต่ละ role, safe comment/note, admin user และ conflict; ห้ามใช้ `...` แทน shape ของ protected data ที่ต้อง review

Error example (proposal, align legacy envelope with approved patch):
```json
{
  "error": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
  "message": "One or more fields are invalid",
  "fields": { "email": "Enter a valid email address" }
}
```

